## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `HypedProError(code, message)`

A real, coded failure — never silently swallowed into a fake reply.

### `ensure_downloaded(model, quiet=False) -> Path`

Download ``model``'s weights if they aren't already cached.

### `extract_thinking(text) -> tuple[str, str | None]`

Split a reply into (visible_text, thinking_text_or_None).

### `strip_thinking(text) -> str`

Remove inline <think>/<thinking>/<reasoning> blocks from a reply.

### `send_chat_message(model_short, messages, system=None, api_key=None, max_tokens=None, max_thinking_tokens=None, hide_thinking=True, enable_tools=True) -> dict[str, str | None]`

Returns {\"content\": <visible reply>, \"thinking\": <extracted thinking

### `catalog_json() -> dict[str, Any]`

Serializable view of MODELS + PROVIDERS for the bridge's `catalog` cmd.

